THIRD-PARTY VENDORED ARTIFACTS
==============================

This directory contains a small set of third-party SKY130 library artifacts that
are NOT authored by the HCMUT_DICD course. They are redistributed here so the
back-end flow (synth / STA / gate-sim / power) is self-contained. Attribution and
licenses:

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
sky130A/libs.ref/sky130_fd_sc_hd/  +  sky130A/libs.tech/  --  std cells + tech
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
A subset of the high-density standard-cell library + the PDK tech decks, enough
to run the WHOLE digital flow in-repo: synth, STA, gate-sim, power, AND APR
(RTL->GDSII). It is still a SUBSET (3 sign-off corners, not all 18; no analog
libs.tech tools) -- see the size/scope note at the bottom.

sky130_fd_sc_hd views:
  lib/sky130_fd_sc_hd__tt_025C_1v80.lib   typical  (LIB_SYNTH/PL/STA)
  lib/sky130_fd_sc_hd__ff_n40C_1v95.lib   fastest  (LIB_FASTEST -> hold/min-corner STA)
  lib/sky130_fd_sc_hd__ss_100C_1v60.lib   slowest  (LIB_SLOWEST -> setup/max-corner STA)
  verilog/sky130_fd_sc_hd.v, verilog/primitives.v   cell models (gate-sim)
  lef/sky130_fd_sc_hd.lef, lef/sky130_ef_sc_hd.lef  abstracts (placement/route)
  techlef/sky130_fd_sc_hd__{min,nom,max}.tlef (+ rram)   tech LEF
  gds/sky130_fd_sc_hd.gds                 std-cell layout (final GDS merge)
  cdl/sky130_fd_sc_hd.cdl                 std-cell netlist (LVS)

libs.tech/ (APR tool decks): magic, klayout, netgen, openlane, combined. These
reference the PDK via $PDK_ROOT, so they are path-portable once vendored. (The
analog/schematic decks ngspice/xschem/irsim/qflow/xcircuit are NOT included.)

