Note: this subset runs the FULL flow in-repo (synth, STA, gate-sim, power, and
APR -> GDSII) for the course designs. It is still trimmed: 3 sign-off corners
(tt/ff/ss) out of 18, only the digital libs.tech decks, and only the
sky130_fd_sc_hd library. For full multi-corner sign-off, other cell libraries, or
analog tools, fetch a COMPLETE PDK with volare/ciel or the conda 'full' profile;
see pdk/README.md.
